            "docstring": "",
            "code": "def toggle_output_data(self):\n\n    is_visible = self.scroll.isVisible()\n    self.scroll.setVisible(not is_visible)\n    self.toggle_output_button_data.setText(\"\u2b9e\u2b9e   TABEL OUTPUT    \u2b9e\u2b9e\" if is_visible else \"\u2b9f\u2b9f   TABLE OUTPUT    \u2b9f\u2b9f\")\n",
