            "title": "apply_theme",
            "revision": "1.0",
            "item_tag": "",
            "docstring": "",
            "code": "def apply_theme(self):\n    setting = load_setting()\n    bg = setting[\"colors\"][\"Back Ground Color WorkWindow\"]\n    \n    self.setStyleSheet(f\"\"\"\n        QFrame {{\n            border: 2px solid {bg};\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            background-color: {bg};\n            padding: 6px;\n        }}\n    \"\"\")\n    \n    # \u0628\u0647\u200c\u0631\u0648\u0632\u0631\u0633\u0627\u0646\u06cc \u062e\u0637\u200c\u0634\u0645\u0627\u0631\u0647\n    if hasattr(self, 'line_number_area'):\n        self.line_number_area.update()",
